Copied icon assets:
- manager/src/main/res/mipmap-{hdpi,xhdpi,xxhdpi,xxxhdpi}/ic_launcher.png
- manager/src/main/res/mipmap-{hdpi,xhdpi,xxhdpi,xxxhdpi}/ic_launcher_background.png
- manager/src/main/res/mipmap-{hdpi,xhdpi,xxhdpi,xxxhdpi}/ic_launcher_foreground.png
- manager/src/main/res/drawable/ic_monochrome.xml
  (resource filename here: ic_shizuku_monochrome.xml)

The adaptive-icon wrapper maps the monochrome resource to its local filename.
The monochrome icon data and PNG assets are unchanged.
Light primary #3F51B5 and dark primary #B1B8DF come from
manager/src/main/res/values/colors.xml; surrounding surface colors are local adaptations.

Shizuku Tile is an independent companion application, not the Shizuku manager.
